Usage: d2u [OPTION]... [FILE]...

Convert DOS line endings to Unix line endings.

Replace CRLF (\r\n) with LF (\n) in each specified file.
If no FILE is specified, read from standard input and write to standard output.

Options:
  -v, --verbose  print a message for each file

OPTIONS:
  -v, --verbose  print a message for each file
      --help     display this help and exit
  -V, --version  output version information and exit

EXIT STATUS:
  0  if OK,
  1  if minor problems,
  2  if serious trouble.

WinuxCmd is a Windows implementation of GNU CoreUtils for Linux-Windows developers and AI coding assistants.
